    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Forgotten. Unravel the Curse. Shipwrecked, you awaken on a remote island cloaked in lust and mystery. In <i>Hero of the Cursed Island</i>, embark on an adventure where your only weapons are your curiosity, courage and lust.<br>Engage with intricate puzzles, environmental storytelling, and hidden relics that shape the fate of the island.<br><br>Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the little island and mingle with its residents in more than one way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and find hidden objects throughout the whole island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a simple but cool story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most important, be ready to let your lust go wild</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you piece together the island\u2019s story, you\u2019ll awaken dormant energies and begin to understand your role in lifting the curse. The evil is watching. Can you win agaisnt it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Not suitable for watching at work </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Not suitable for all ages </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-All characters in the game are over 18 years old</p>",
